---
title: ProximaDB - Read Path (Vector Search) Sequence
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant REST as REST/gRPC/ArrowFlight
    participant Auth as Auth Middleware
    participant Tenant as TenantContext
    participant Svc as SearchService
    participant Sched as ComputeScheduler
    participant Plan as QueryPlanner
    participant Exec as VolcanoExecutor
    participant DF as DataFusion(OLAP)
    participant Cat as CatalogManager
    participant Index as IndexManager(HNSW/IVF)
    participant RecStore as RecordStore
    participant WAL as WAL
    participant Mem as Memtable
    participant Seg as SegmentReader
    participant PAX as PAX Block
    participant ObjStore as ObjectStore
    participant Cache as QueryCache
    participant Rank as ReRank/Fusion
    participant Metrics as Billing

    Note over Client, Metrics: Vector ANN search + metadata filter

    Client->>REST: POST /v1/collections/{id}/search
    REST->>Auth: Validate + TenantContext
    Auth-->>REST: identity + tenant
    REST->>Tenant: extract tenant_ctx
    REST->>Svc: search(query_vector, filter, top_k, tenant_ctx)

    Svc->>Cat: lookup_collection(id)
    Cat-->>Svc: CollectionSchema + IndexConfig + StorageLayout

    Svc->>Sched: route_select(plan, freshness, profile)
    Note over Sched: FreshnessMode? → Cache decision
    Sched->>Cache: check(Strong?) → skip if Strong
    Note over Sched: route per workload profile + cardinality class

    alt OLTP / Strong Freshness (Native Volcano)
        Sched->>Plan: plan_query() → PhysicalPlan
        Plan-->>Sched: ExecNode tree
        Sched->>Exec: execute(plan, tenant_ctx)

        Exec->>Index: search_nearest(vector, top_k)
        Index-->>Exec: candidate_ids + distances

        Exec->>RecStore: batch_get(ids, filter, tenant_ctx)
        RecStore->>WAL: read_recent(ids) — unflushed
        RecStore->>Mem: read_memtable(ids)
        RecStore->>Seg: read_segment(ids) — flushed PAX
        Seg->>PAX: column_project(ids, selected_columns)
        Seg->>ObjStore: get_object(range_read)
        ObjStore-->>Seg: PAX blocks
        Seg-->>RecStore: decoded ProximaRecords
        RecStore-->>Exec: records (merged WAL+Mem+Segment)

        Exec->>Rank: rerank(results, original_query)
        Rank-->>Exec: ranked_results
        Exec-->>Svc: SearchResults

    else OLAP / Eventual (DataFusion)
        Sched->>DF: route to DataFusion
        DF->>ObjStore: read parquet row-groups
        DF-->>Svc: Arrow RecordBatch results
    end

    Svc->>Cache: put(query_key, results, ttl)
    Svc->>Metrics: emit(KRU: read_ops, KOU: result_bytes)
    Svc-->>REST: SearchResponse (ids, scores, metadata)
    REST-->>Client: 200 OK { results, latency_ms }
